  "body": "event: message.started\ndata: {}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"检索到 3 条知识库片段（抽取式\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"回答，本阶段未接入生成模型）：\\n\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"1. redis-persist\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"ence.md › Redis \"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"持久化\\n   # Redis 持\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"久化\\n   Redis 提供 R\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"DB 快照与 AOF 追加日志两\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"种持久化方式，取舍点在于恢复速度\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"与写入 durability。\\n\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"2. redis-persist\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"ence.md › Redis \"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"持久化 / AOF\\n   ## \"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"AOF\\n   AOF 以追加写记\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"录每条写命令，fsync 策略可\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"以选 always、everys\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"ec 或 no。\\n3. redi\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"s-persistence.md\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\" › Redis 持久化 / R\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"DB\\n   ## RDB\\n   \"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"RDB 在 fork 出的子进程\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"里生成内存快照，代价与实例内存大\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"小相关。\\n问题：Redis 持久\"}\n\nevent: message.delta\ndata: {\"delta\":\"化 AOF 与 RDB 怎么取舍\"}\n\nevent: message.completed\ndata: {\"content\":\"检索到 3 条知识库片段（抽取式回答，本阶段未接入生成模型）：\\n1. redis-persistence.md › Redis 持久化\\n   # Redis 持久化\\n   Redis 提供 RDB 快照与 AOF 追加日志两种持久化方式，取舍点在于恢复速度与写入 durability。\\n2. redis-persistence.md › Redis 持久化 / AOF\\n   ## AOF\\n   AOF 以追加写记录每条写命令，fsync 策略可以选 always、everysec 或 no。\\n3. redis-persistence.md › Redis 持久化 / RDB\\n   ## RDB\\n   RDB 在 fork 出的子进程里生成内存快照，代价与实例内存大小相关。\\n问题：Redis 持久化 AOF 与 RDB 怎么取舍\",\"message_id\":\"message-N\",\"sources\":[{\"source_id\":\"src-O\",\"document_id\":\"document-O\",\"collection_id\":\"collection-O\",\"chunk_id\":\"document-O\",\"title\":\"redis-persistence.md\",\"section\":\"Redis 持久化\",\"snippet\":\"# Redis 持久化\\nRedis 提供 RDB 快照与 AOF 追加日志两种持久化方式，取舍点在于恢复速度与写入 durability。\"},{\"source_id\":\"src-O\",\"document_id\":\"document-O\",\"collection_id\":\"collection-O\",\"chunk_id\":\"document-O\",\"title\":\"redis-persistence.md\",\"section\":\"Redis 持久化 / AOF\",\"snippet\":\"## AOF\\nAOF 以追加写记录每条写命令，fsync 策略可以选 always、everysec 或 no。\"},{\"source_id\":\"src-O\",\"document_id\":\"document-O\",\"collection_id\":\"collection-O\",\"chunk_id\":\"document-O\",\"title\":\"redis-persistence.md\",\"section\":\"Redis 持久化 / RDB\",\"snippet\":\"## RDB\\nRDB 在 fork 出的子进程里生成内存快照，代价与实例内存大小相关。\"}]}\n\n"
